    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203330/extras/0a147b1887766b2872902fa3c65d43a1.poster.avif?t=1734207345\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203330/extras/0a147b1887766b2872902fa3c65d43a1.webp?t=1734207345\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>Tired from work?<br>Want to be healed?<br>Now is your time to come to our establishment!<br>Play with our classic maid from the 2000 eras style and the boss that will give you a bit of spice in your life!<br>Yakyuuken, Kakurenbo, Daruma-san, Makuranage, and Moe-Moe Kyun!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203330/extras/f64eb19809a06a6900ac855f95bd36f4.poster.avif?t=1734207345\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203330/extras/f64eb19809a06a6900ac855f95bd36f4.webp?t=1734207345\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>The game has 5 minigames :<br>- Strip rock paper scissors where if you win you will get those pieces of clothing off one by one<br>- Hide and seek where you must search for the maid hiding in the store to get her to reward you<br>- Red light green light where you must stop when the maid says so and reach for the goal<br>- Reverse tower defense where you must reach the goal when getting shoot from every direction possible<br>- lastly the game is about following the maid's directions to make your meal yummier<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203330/extras/de02bdddbdf5d9c75ca3b309f9616a2b.poster.avif?t=1734207345\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203330/extras/de02bdddbdf5d9c75ca3b309f9616a2b.webp?t=1734207345\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>- 5 minigames that will give you many options of clothing!<br>- 2 unique heroine with their own story<br>- 7 maids to play with every day<br>- pregnancy incoming(?)",
